  "description": "The SilverRider Gravel Sport builds on the same fast, responsive gravel race frameset, but evolves it for long‑range comfort and mixed‑terrain endurance. The drop‑bar cockpit adds multiple hand positions for better efficiency over distance, while the rider‑forward stem keeps steering calm and predictable on rough roads. A tuned suspension fork smooths out chatter and washboard surfaces, helping riders conserve energy hour after hour. It’s the same agile, efficient platform—now optimized for bigger days, broader horizons, and more comfortable touring on unpredictable terrain. Finished with smooth welds, recycled alloy, water‑based paints, and laser‑etched details, the SilverRider Gravel is crafted in small batches, backed by a lifetime warranty, and built to perform at the highest level.",
